lnp-proofs/pull/9069.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9069.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-25T03:27:28Z"},"body":"Reduces L-meta-2592 to a circuit normalization lemma and the remaining bound for normalized circuits.\n\nThe normalization preserves the computed function, makes the last gate the output, and leaves only references to available wires. A NOT gate has at most one operand. If the original NOT gates are all removed, the gate count strictly decreases.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9069/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9069/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9127","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9127/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9127/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9127/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9127","id":6589768947,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRpH0UQ","number":9127,"title":"L-meta-2592 (reduction)","user":{"login":"dmcyer","id":35415011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NDE1MDEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35415011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer","html_url":"https://github.com/dmcyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmcyer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-24T19:31:57Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T20:02:53Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T20:02:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/9127","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9127","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9127.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9127.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Reduction for L-meta-2592: splitting size <= 19 into size < 19 or size = 19. Verified locally with check-lean.mjs reduce.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9127/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4818","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4818/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4818/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4818/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4818","id":6578543335,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRgBEdg","number":4818,"title":"R-meta-2592-1","user":{"login":"danorris709","id":33832062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODMyMDYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33832062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709","html_url":"https://github.com/danorris709","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danorris709/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-24T09:19:05Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T18:08:53Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T18:08:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/4818","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4818","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4818.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/4818.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Reduction of `L-meta-2592` (Petersen graph, at most 19 gates, at least one NOT gate) to two statements.\n\nSet one vertex to false. A gate that becomes constant, or equal to an earlier wire, costs nothing. If some vertex frees four gates, at most 15 gates are left, and they compute the edge function of the Petersen graph minus a vertex. The ten restrictions are isomorphic; the isomorphisms are in the file. The elimination is proved inside the reduction.\n\n1. `minusVertex`: the edge function of the Petersen graph minus a vertex has no circuit with at most 15 gates. This should match the bound the first-gate cases (`L-meta-1672` and its siblings) are working towards; I did not check whether it is already posted in this exact form.\n2. `fewFree`: the same statement as `L-meta-2592`, restricted to circuits where setting any one vertex to false makes at most three gates constant or equal to an earlier wire. In particular each vertex frees at most three gates.\n\nThe second child keeps the 19-gate bound and the NOT gate, so it is still open; what it gains is the extra restriction.\n\n**Checks run.** The module builds, and the project verifier (`checklemma`, kind `reduce`, run directly on Windows) accepted it, with axioms `propext`, `Quot.sound` and `Classical.choice` only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/4818/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5129","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5129/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5129/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5129/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5129","id":6579214598,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRgjvIw","number":5129,"title":"R-meta-2592-