_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/15013","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/15013.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/15013.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"**Gap id** (from the desk, for example `L-gct-101`): L-meta-2592\n\n**The one file this adds** (the `file` the desk gave you): lean/PEqualNP/Outside/R_meta_2592_671.lean\n\n**Agent used** (keep exactly one line):\n- Claude Code\n\n**X handle** (optional; shown on your credit card on pequalnp.com; for example `@name`):\n\n**LinkedIn profile** (optional; shown on your credit card; the full address, for example `https://www.linkedin.com/in/name`):\n\n**Checklist**\n- [x] This pull request adds exactly one file and edits no other file.\n- [x] The file proves the exact statement the desk gave me, unchanged.\n- [x] No `sorry`, no new `axiom`, no `native_decide`.\n- [x] It builds locally with the pinned toolchain.\n\nReduction (kind reduce) of L-meta-2592 into two children, split by the number of NOT gates in a circuit of at most 19 gates that contains a NOT gate:\n1. one: circuits with exactly one NOT gate do not compute the Petersen edge function.\n2. many: circuits with at least two NOT gates do not compute it.\nLocal check: `node tools/check-lean.mjs ... reduce` prints ACCEPTED (reduce), axioms [propext, Quot.sound].\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DWBYkiBa55yecFVrW17sg1","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/15013/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11694","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11694/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11694/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11694/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11694","id":6595989482,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRuGcxQ","number":11694,"title":"Reduce L-meta-2592 at the last inversion","user":{"login":"zxylab","id":44428592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDI4NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44428592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab","html_url":"https://github.com/zxylab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zxylab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-25T02:44:11Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:14:04Z","closed_at":"2026-11-25T05:14:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/11694","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11694","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11694.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/11694.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-25T05:14:04Z"},"body":"Reduction for L-meta-2592. Cut the circuit at its last inverter. The entire pre-inversion wire vector and one complemented wire become the inputs to an AND/OR suffix. This preserves sharing and charges the inverter exactly once. The Petersen-specific lower bound on the remaining 18 gates is open.\n\nThe first child (the graph-independent factorization) was separately checked with the pinned toolchain. Its proof is included here for reuse.\n\n<details><summary>Lean proof of the first child</summary>\n\n```lean\nimport PEqualNP.Defs\n\nopen PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds PEqualNP.MetaComplexity in\ntheorem cutLastVerified : ∀ (n : ℕ) (C : Circuit), FanInTwo C →\n      (∃ g ∈ C.gates, g.op = GateOp.not) →\n      ∃ P Q : Circuit, FanInTwo P ∧ Monotone2 Q ∧ P.size + Q.size + 1 = C.size ∧\n        ∀ x : Fin n → Bool, C.eval (List.ofFn x) =\n          Q.eval (P.wires (List.ofFn x) ++ [!P.eval (List.ofFn x)]) := by\n  intro n C fan hasNot\n  have splitLast (l : List Gate) (h : ∃ g ∈ l, g.op = GateOp.not) :\n      ∃ a g b, l = a ++ g :: b ∧ g.op = GateOp.not ∧\n        ∀ k ∈ b, k.op ≠ GateOp.not := by\n    induction l with\n    | nil => simp at h\n    | cons t ts ih =>\n      by_cases ht : ∃ g ∈ ts, g.op = GateOp.not\n      · obtain ⟨a, g, b, rfl, hg, hb⟩ := ih ht\n        exact ⟨t :: a, g, b, rfl, hg, hb⟩\n      · obtain ⟨g, hg, hop⟩ := h\n        rcases List.mem_cons.mp hg with rfl | hm\n        · exact ⟨[], g, ts, rfl, hop, fun k hk he => ht ⟨k, hk, he⟩⟩\n        · exact (ht ⟨g, hm, hop⟩).elim\n  obtain ⟨a, g, b, eqn, hop, noNot⟩ := splitLast C.gates hasNot\n  let P : Circuit := ⟨a, g.inputs.headD (n + a.length)⟩\n  let Q : Circuit := ⟨b, C.output⟩\n  refine ⟨P, Q, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩\n  · intro k hk\n    apply fan k\n    rw [eqn]\n    exact List.mem_append_left _ hk\n  · intro k hk\n    have mem : k ∈ C.gates := by\n      rw [eqn]\n      exact List.mem_append_right _ (List.mem_cons_of_mem _ hk)\n    obtain ⟨op, sz⟩ := fan k mem\n    refine ⟨?_, sz⟩\n    simp only [Set.mem_insert_iff, Set.mem_singleton_iff] at op ⊢\n    exact op.elim Or.inl (fun h => Or.inr (h.resolve_right (noNot k hk)))\n  · simp [Circuit.size, P, Q, eqn]\n    omega\n  · intro x\n    have lengthW (gs : List Gate) (w : List Bool) :\n        ((Circuit.mk gs 0).wires w).length = w.length + gs.length := by\n      induction gs generalizing w with\n      | nil => simp [Circuit.wires]\n      | cons t ts ih =>\n        change ((Circuit.mk ts 0).wires (_ ++ [_])).length = _\n        rw [ih]\n        simp\n        omega\n    have hlen : (P.wires (List.ofFn x)).length = n + a.length := by\n      simpa [P, Circuit.wires] using lengthW a (List.ofFn x)\n    have val : g.op.eval (g.inputs.map fun k => (P.wires (List.ofFn x)).getD k false) =\n        !P.eval (List.ofFn x) := by\n      rw [hop]\n      cases hh : g.inputs with\n      | nil =>\n        simp [GateOp.eval, Circuit.eval, P, hh, List.getD_eq_getElem?_getD]\n        change ((P.wires (List.ofFn x))[n + a.length]?).getD false = false\n        rw [List.getElem?_eq_none (Nat.le_of_eq hlen)]\n        rfl\n      | cons i is => simp [GateOp.eval, Circuit.eval, P, hh]\n    simpa only [Circuit.eval, Circuit.wires, eqn, List.foldl_append, List.foldl_cons,\n      Q, P] using congrArg (fun v => Q.eval (P.wires (List.ofFn x) ++ [v])) val\n```\n\n</details>\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/11694/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/7669","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/7669/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.g