"body":"Separates the lower bound of 15 AND or OR gates from the case of a circuit with at most four NOT gates. The 15-gate bound follows from the six branching wires forced by the Petersen graph and the nine binary gates needed to combine ten inputs. The local proof of that bound adapts the branch-count argument in L-meta-2165.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/7669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/7669/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5542","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5542/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5542/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/5542/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/5542","id":6580078627,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRhQyQg","number":5542,"title":"L-meta-2592: bound NOT gates by Petersen branching","user":{"login":"AkshatGiri","id":20054565,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDU0NTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20054565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri","html_url":"https://github.com/AkshatGiri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/orgs"