://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20054565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri","html_url":"https://github.com/AkshatGiri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AkshatGiri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-24T16:00:08Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:12:34Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T19:12:34Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/7606","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/7606","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/7606.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/7606.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-24T19:12:34Z"},"body":"The reduction proves that the Petersen edge function requires at least fifteen binary gates. Under the nineteen-gate budget, this leaves at most four NOT gates. The remaining child asks whether a circuit with one through four NOT gates can meet the budget.\n\nThe binary gate lower bound has a standalone Lean proof, and the reduction passed the local project checker. The desk reassigned this step after #5542 was closed by the queue without a check.\n","r